  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "金融保險精算導論(一)",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO FINANCE, INSURANCE, AND ACTUARIAL SCIENCE (I)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在培養學生對全球金融市場、金融機構運作、投資與風險管理、保險、精算與金融科技的核心概念，並探討金融科技、永續金融與產業創新的影響。透過企業參訪、案例分析與專題討論，學生將全面認識金融學院三大領域的發展與應用，為未來職涯選擇奠定堅實基礎。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to develop students' understanding of core concepts in global financial markets, financial institution operations, investment and risk management, actuarial science, and fintech. It also looks into the impact of fintech, sustainable finance, and industrial innovation. Through company visits, case studies, and topic discussions, students will gain a thorough understanding of the development and application of the College of Finance's three major fields, laying the groundwork for their future career choices.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "了解金融市場與機構運作，掌握投資工具與風險管理基礎",
      "describe_en": "Understand financial markets and institutional operations, mastering investment tools and risk management fundamentals."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "透過案例分析與問題導向學習，學習跨領域整合與解決問題能力的知識",
      "describe_en": "Learning interdisciplinary integration and problem-solving skills through case analysis and problem-based learning."
    }
  ],
